<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">Tagin: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">Hebru</para>
  <para style="toc1">HEBRU vdwa Siti jinam</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hebru</para>
  <para style="toc3">Heb</para>
  <para style="mt1">HEBRU</para>
  <para style="mt2">vdwa Siti Jinam</para>
  <para style="imt">Mintamchonam</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Hebru vdwa siti jinam </char> si Kristan nyi nyitwng gonyi lvktoku, bunu kaiyayabv nyirunv nyi vdwa tormilarmi sila rinyato, vbv maatarbv rimisikulo Kristan gv mvngjwng nga topak dukubv ritoku. Vbvrinammv Lvknv angv bunugv mvngjwng nga mintvmirula Jisu Kristo Pwknvyarnv gv jvjv okv ataranyabv nyikrwkaatam kunam vkv vla mindu. Vbv ridula nw jvjvnv aba baom go minjido: (1) Jisu dvbvsvngtambv turbwngnv Pwknvyarnv gv Kuunyilo ngv, yvvdw ninyigv hinching nga himv sunam lokv Abua jvjv rungbv tvvjirijinv akobv chinsu toku. Pwknvyarnv gv Kuunyilo gubv ridula, Jisu Aku Pvbv gv nyijwk vdwa, nyidogindung vdwa, okv Moses nyika achialvbv kaiyanvngv. (2) Jisu Pwknvyarnv gv dvbvsvngtambv nyibu gubv mvkunam angv, Aku Pvbv lokv nyibu dvdv nga achialvbv kaiyanvngv. (3) Jisu gvlokv mvngjwngnv vdwv rimur, busu, okv sinam lokv ringnam ha paadunv; okv Jisu, Butvyachok nvgobv rila jvjvnv ringlinbaalin nama jidu, um Hebru dormo lo nyibuv beela okv svnwngsvmin erinpeelwk lakula rikunamv hv aainvgv ringlinbaalin kuse nga kaagvsidubv kaatam kunamv.</para>
  <para style="ip">(Mvrwmvpa 11) lo Israel nyi vdwgv higu lo mvngjwng gv lvkwnglo yungnam nyi vdwa minpa dula, lvknv angv puririnv vdwa mvngjwnglo alvbv doobwng tvlaka vla kumla mindu, okv mvrwmvpa 12 lo nw ninyigv purinv vdwa nyikkv Jisunyi kaagap dula, jwkjwkvrwk nama ataranya lobv rilin laka vla mintvmirudo, okv bunua hinching chingnam okv mvdwkmvku namv aajeka mvngrwla ribwng minsu laka vla mindu. Kitap si minsartamsarnam okv gamrwnam gaam vkv minla minya duku.</para>
  <para style="iot">Arwng lokv darlinnam</para>
  <para style="io1">Mintamchonam: Kristo Pwknvyarnv gurungbv kaatam kunam angv <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HEB 1:1-3">1:1-3</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kristo nyidogindung vdwa kaiyadunv <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HEB 1:4-2:18">1:4—2:18</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kristo Moses okv Josuanyi kaiyadunv. <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HEB 3:1-4:13">3:1—4:13</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kristo gv nyibu gubvrila kaiyachok kunam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HEB 4:14-7:28">4:14—7:28</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kristo gv milv kunamv kaiyachoknv <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HEB 8:1-9:28">8:1—9:28</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kristo gv erinpeeji namv kaiyachoknv <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HEB 10:1-39">10:1-39</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mvngjwng gv dinchiyachoknam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HEB 11:1-12:29">11:1—12:29</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Pwknvyarnvnyi mvngpu monam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HEB 13:1-19">13:1-19</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kumnyungkumnya bv kumnam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HEB 13:20-21">13:20-21</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Minyabv mingkunam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HEB 13:22-25">13:22-25</ref>) </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1"/>
  <para style="s">Pwknvyarnv gv Gamchar hv Ninyigv Kuunyilo gv lokv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1"/>Pwknvyarnv krim ngonugv abuapa vdwa nyijwk vdw gvlokv achialvgo okv aku-akusinv lamtv lokv gaam japtoku, <verse eid="HEB 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2"/>vbvritola ataranya alu vdwso nw ninyigv Kuunyilo gv lokv ngonua japduku. Nw hvkvnv nyi ako ninyigv lokv Pwknvyarnv chinggodogo nga pwklinyarlin pvkunv, okv ataranya alu lo ogumvnwng nga paamu dukubv Pwknvyarnv ninyia darpvkunv. <verse eid="HEB 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3"/>Nw Pwknvyarnv gv achialvbv Yunglit kunam ha unglit kargojito okv Pwknvyarnv oguaingbv ripvdw vbv aringchingnv, ninyigv jwkrw doonv gamchar lokv chinggodogo nga turmudu. Nyia nyi mvnwng gv rimur vdwa mvngnga dukubv rijiro kochingbvku, nw nyidomooku tolo Kaiyachokbv jwkrw bv rinv, Pwknvyarnv gv lakbik tangvlo doolwk pvku.<verse eid="HEB 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pwknvyarnv gv Kuunyilo gv Kainam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4"/>Kuunyilo nga nyidogindung vdwa kaiyanv gubv mvpvnv, Pwknvyarnv gv ninyia amin jinamv bunu vdwgv amin hv kaiyanvngv. <verse eid="HEB 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Miri 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 7:14">2Sam 7:14</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:13">1Kri 17:13</ref></char></note>Vkvlvgabv Pwknvyarnv ninyigv nyidogindung vdwa vdwloka vbv mimato</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">“No ngoogv Kuunyilo ngv;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">Silu ngo noogv Abu bv ridu.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:5">Pwknvyarnv nyidogindung vdwa vbvka mima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">“Ngo ninyigv Abu bv rire,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">okv nw ngoogv Kuunyilo bv rire.”<verse eid="HEB 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:43">Det 32:43</ref> </char>
    </note>Vbvritola Pwknvyarnv vdwlo ninyigv Kuunyilo bvngtua nyia mooku lo vngmu tvikulo nw vbv minto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:6">“Pwknvyarnv gv nyidogindung mvnwngngv ninyia kumrungjorung laka.”<verse eid="HEB 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 104:4">Miri 104:4</ref> </char>
    </note>Vbvritola nyidogindung gv lvkwnglo Pwknvyarnv vbv minto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">“Pwknvyarnv ninyigv nyidogindung vdwa doori bv mvto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:7">okv ninyigv pakbu vdwa vmv gv mvriakbv mvtoku.”<verse eid="HEB 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:8,9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 45:6">Miri 45:6</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 45:7">7</ref></char>
    </note>Kuunyilo gv lvkwnglo, ogubvrijeka, Pwknvyarnv minto:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">“Ho Pwknvyarnv ngam, noogv<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nogv karvnga, O Pwknvyarnv, adwng rongre; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Pwknvyarnv nogv karv ngv</char></note> karv ngv dvbvsingtambv ataranya gobv doobwngre!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:8">No noogv nyi vdwa jvjv<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nogv; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitaplo doodu</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nwgv</char></note> lokv rigvdogvre.<verse eid="HEB 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9"/>No jvjv nvnga pakdu okv rimur nvnga no kaanwng madu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:9">Vkvlvgabv Pwknvyarnv, noogv Pwknvyarnv, nam darpvkunv</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">okv noogv richam ajin vdwa kaiyago</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">nam hv mvngdv okv mvngpusakpua jiyapvnv.”<verse eid="HEB 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:10-12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 102:25-27">Miri 102:25-27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nw vbvka mintato,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:10">“Ahtu, no, atuake ho sichingmookua pwklinto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:10">okv no atubogv laak lokv no nyidomooku vdwa mvpvkunv.<verse eid="HEB 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11"/>Bunu nyeriku, vbvritola no doobwngre;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:11">bunu vji nyenam aingbv nyeare.<verse eid="HEB 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12"/>No bunua jvtvlaklwk ha tinam aingbv tireku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">okv bunu vji aingbv akusubv ridinre.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">Vbvritola no vbvdvdvbv doobwngre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">okv noogv svngtung ngv vdwloka nyemare.”<verse eid="HEB 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Miri 110:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Pwknvyarnv ninyigv nyidogindung vdwa vdwloka vbv mimato:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">“Ngoogv lakbik tangvso dootung tvka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">ngo noogv nyimak vdwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">noogv lvpa lvkwnglo vvpvma dvdvlo.”<verse eid="HEB 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14"/>Vbvrikunamv nyidogindung vdwv oguv? Bunu dow bv rila Pwknvyarnvnyi rijiyanv okv yvvbunudw ringlinbaalin nama paajikunv vdwa nw bunua ho vngmula ridur yamudu.<verse eid="HEB 1:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2"/>
  <para style="s">Kairungnv Ringlinbaalin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1"/>Vkvlvgabv ngonugv jvjv nvgo tvvnam a ngonu kaiyasinbv gakbwngla rirung tvka, vbvribolo ngonu jvjvnv lamtv nga vnggak pamare. <verse eid="HEB 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2"/>Ngonugv abuapa vdwa nyidogindung vdwgv doin jinammv jvjv rungbv kaatam duku, okv yvvbunudw hoogv minkulo vngming gvmanv vmalo tvvmanv vdwv bunugv mvritririt paasenga paanyato. <verse eid="HEB 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3"/>Vbvrinamv ngonu svkvnv kairungnv ringlinbaalin nama tvvmabv ritola ngonu oguaingbv riyvriko sinyure? Ahtu nw atubongv so gv ringlinbaalin nam sum minpa jichoto, okv yvvbunudw ninyi gvlo um tvvnv vdwv si jvjv ngvrung vla minpa jitoku. <verse eid="HEB 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4"/>Vbvririlo Pwknvyarnv ninyigv nvgwngnv kaasartabonv okv lamrwpanam rinam lokv bunugv aolo kaatam dula okv ninyigv mvnglwkbv Darwknv Dow gv amin am jito okv mincho namv vv rung vla vbvrila kaatam toku.<verse eid="HEB 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ngonua Ringlinbaalin kolo vnggvnv angv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5"/>Pwknvyarnv aajinv anwnv nyiamooku ha nyidogindung vdwa rigvdogv modubv tolwkma—ngonugv minggvdvnam mooku homnv. <verse eid="HEB 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:4-6">Miri 8:4-6</ref></char></note> Vmabvya, Darwknv kitaplo ako-akonvlo vbv mindu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">“O Pwknvyarnv, noogv bunugv lvgabv mvngya gvdunamv, nyi vdw si oguv;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:6">Noogv kaayataya gvdunamv, nyi vmwng gumalare?<verse eid="HEB 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7"/>No bunua nyidogindung vdwa achukgo miyang yadubv mvtoku;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:7">no bunuam yunglit gvnvgv okv mvngdv<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Achilvnv kitap vdwlo lwkpwngdo: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">No bunua noogv pwknamyarnam mvngwng ngam rigv modubv mvtoku. </char></note> gvnvgv biotung nga pilwk toku,<verse eid="HEB 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8"/>okv bunua ogumvnwng nga rigvdogv modubv mvtoku.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:8">Ho mindu Pwknvyarnv bunua mvpvnv “Ogumvnwng nga rigvdogv nvgobv”; si ogumvnwng nga miominchik laikula minbwk jidu. Vbvrijvka, nyi vdw sum ogumvnwng nga rigvdogv dubv vjak ngonu kaapa yamadu. <verse eid="HEB 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9"/>Vbvritola ngonu Jisunyi kaapa dunv, ninyia achukchanyi gv lvgabv nyidogindung vdwa miangyadubv mvpvnv, vkvlvgavbolo Pwknvyarnv gv ayakolokv nw mvnwng gv lvgabv siji rungdukubv vla. Ninyigv hinching chinla sinam lokv ngonu ninyi vjak kairungnv okv mvngdvrungnv gv biotung nga gvla doodu kubv kaapa duku. <verse eid="HEB 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10"/>Pwknvyarnv pwklinyarlinnv okv ogumvnwng nga vvpvnv, ninyigv kai kunam a baak dukubv kuu achialvgo naalwk kunam lvgabv Jisunyi hinching chingnam lo rilak nvgobv rimula rinam si rijwkkv. Vkvlvgabv Jisu mvngchik bunua ringlinbaalin kolo vnggv kujinv.<verse eid="HEB 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11"/>Nw nyi vdwa bunugv rimur loka kakdar dukubv mvdunv, okv kakdarkunam mvnwngngvla okv nw la anyi gv Abuv akin dukunv. Vkvlvkwngbv Jisu bunua ninyigv achiboru gubv minam lvgabv hinying matoku. <verse eid="HEB 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:22">Miri 22:22</ref></char></note> Nw Pwknvyarnvnyi mintoku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">“No ogugo ripvkudw ngo ngoogv achiboru vdwa minpa jireku;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:12">bunu vdwgv doopam lo ngo nam hartv reku.”<verse eid="HEB 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13"/>Nw vbv mintato, “Ngo ngoogv mvngjwng nga Pwknvyarnv gvlo jwnglwk reku.” Okv nw vbvka minta tuku, “Ngo svka Pwknvyarnv gv ngam vmi jinam vdwa lvkobv doodunv.”<verse eid="HEB 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14"/>Ninyigv vmi vdwv vla mingv dvnam hv adwn bvla oyi bv rinv nyi vdwa mindunv, Jisu nw atubongv bunugv apiabv rila okv bunugv nyi nyipw bv rimingvto. Nw gv vbvrinam si nw gv sinam lokv Uyudvbvnyi mvyakmvchak dubv ritoku, sinam gv aolo rigvyanv anga, <verse eid="HEB 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15"/>okv vbv rigvrila yvvbunudw sinam ha busu laila svngam mvnwngnga nyirabv rinv vdwa ringlin dukubv. <verse eid="HEB 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 41:8">Aij 41:8</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 41:9">9</ref> </char></note>Si minbwk jila mindu nyidogindung vdwa nw ridorma. Vmabvya Darwknv Kitap hv vbv mindu, “Nw Abraham gv husi vdwa ridur yadu.” <verse eid="HEB 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17"/>Vbvrinam hv manv nw rinam mvnwnglo nw gv achiboru vdwgv apiabv ridubv ritoku, Pwknvyarnv gv kudungkua rinamlo nw bunu vdwgv lvgabv jwkjwkvrwk okv ayanv Butvyachok gubv rinam lvgabv, vkvlvgavbolo nyi vdwgv rimur hv mvngnga kunam lvgabv. <verse eid="HEB 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18"/>Okv vjak nw pokayarka kunam vdwa ridur nyulare, ogulvgavbolo nw atubongv pokayarka kunamv okv hinching chingkunv.<verse eid="HEB 2:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3"/>
  <para style="s">Jisu Mosesnyi Kaiyanv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1"/>Pwknvyarnv gv gokta kunam ngoogv kristan ajin vdwa! ngonugv mvngjwng kunamlo Pwknvyarnv gv Butvyachok gubv vngmukunam Jisunyi nonu mvngka toka. <verse eid="HEB 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 12:7">Num 12:7</ref></char></note> Moses gv Pwknvyarnvnaam lo kudungkua nga jwkjwkvrwk bv rinam apiabv, nw Pwknvyarnv gvlo jwkjwkvrwk nvgobv ritoku, Pwknvyarnv ninyia so gv kudungkua nga ridubv jitoku. <verse eid="HEB 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3"/>Naam ha svnga mvnv nyi angv kaiyago mvngdv nga paadunv. Ho apiabv Moses nyimam svnga Jisu achialvbv mvngdvnam gubv ridunv. <verse eid="HEB 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4"/>Mvnam gvbv naam mvnwngnga mvnv akonv mvdunv—okv ogumvnwng nga mvnv ngv Pwknvyarnv akin. <verse eid="HEB 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5"/>Moses Pwknvyarnv gv naam lo Pakbu gubvrila jwkjwkvrwk nvgobv ritoku, okv Pwknvyarnv gv aainvgv lvgabv minse nga nw mintoku. <verse eid="HEB 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6"/>Vbvritola Kristo jwkjwkvrwknv Kuunyilo gubvrila Pwknvyarnv gv naam ha rigvdogv nvgobv rito. Ngonu mvngpak nvgobv rila mvngtinnam lo doobwng bolo ngonu Pwknvyarnv gv naam bv ridunv.<verse eid="HEB 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pwknvyarnv gv nyi vdwgv lvgabv Doonu kogo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:7-11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 95:7-11">Miri 95:7-11</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Vkvlvgabv, Darwknv Dow hv vbv minto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:7">“Nonu silu Pwknvyarnv gv vlv nga tvvpadubolo,<verse eid="HEB 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8"/>nonugv abuapa vdwgv Pwknvyarnvnyi rinyingriru rilo rinam apiabv nonu vlwnghapok bv gvyoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:8">bunugv ninyi rikwripakri alulo bunu chukrimooku lo renya toku.<verse eid="HEB 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9"/>Pwknvyarnv mindu, bunu ngoogv anying champigo ogu—ogu rinam ha kaapv tvlaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:9">hoka bunu nga rikwripakla okv rikw nyatoku.<verse eid="HEB 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10"/>Okv vkvlvgabv ngo ho nyi vdwa haachi laku okv minto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">‘Bunu alu gv dwkia nga pakmarisubv rinyadu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">okv ngoogv gamki nama tvjimakv vnyadu.’<verse eid="HEB 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11"/>Ngo haachila okv milv toku:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:11">‘Ngoogv bunua doonu modubv jinam mookulo bunu vdwloka aanyu kumare!’”<verse eid="HEB 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12"/>Ngoogv ajin vdwa nonugv lokv yvv akonvka haapok v alvmabv rila okv mvngjwng mabv rila turnv Pwknvyarnvnyi dakkur nyola adu manam lvgabv himasuto laka. <verse eid="HEB 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13"/>Vmabvya, vbvrinam lvgabv nonugv lokv yvv akonvka rimur gv kubnam gubv okv vlwnghapok bv rimabvka, Darwknv kitaplo “Silu” vla ngonua minbv dvdvlobv nonu ajinanyingnga ridur minsu laka. <verse eid="HEB 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14"/>Ngonugv kvvlo gv mvngtin nama ataranya lobv hvngdwngbv vvbwng dubolo ngonu Kristonyi lvkobv richam gubv ridunv.<verse eid="HEB 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 95:7">Miri 95:7</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 95:8">8</ref></char>
    </note> Darwknv kitaplo svbvching mindu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">“Nonuno silu Pwknvyarnv gv vlv nga tvvpadubolo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">nonugv abuapa vdwv vdwlo bunu Pwknvyarnvnyi rinyingriru tokudw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">bunu vlwnghapok bv rinya toku vbv nonuno vbv vlwnghapok bv rinya mabvka.”<verse eid="HEB 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:16-18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 14:1-35">Num 14:1-35</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Yvv bunula Pwknvyarnv gv vlv nga tvvtola ninyia rinyingrirunv vdwv? Moses gv Ijipt lokvnga linggv kunam mvnwngngv. <verse eid="HEB 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17"/>Yvv bunuala Pwknvyarnv anying champigo haachi kunamv? Rimur nyala yvvbunudw chukrimooku lo sinya tokudw ho nyi vdwa. <verse eid="HEB 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18"/>Vdwlo Pwknvyarnv ninyigv dinchirungbv milv nama mvtokubvdw, “Ngoogv bunua doonu dubv jinam mookulo bunu vdwloka aanyumare”—vbv minam si yvv bunua minpvnv? Rinyingrirunv vdwa mintoku. <verse eid="HEB 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19"/>Vbvrikunamv ngonu kaapa duku bunu ho mooku lo aapa nyumato ogulvgavbolo bunu mvngjwng matoku.<verse eid="HEB 3:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1"/>Vjak, Pwknvyarnv ngonua milvvnamgo jiduku ngonua ninyigv doonu vla minkunam anga paamu dukubv vla. Vbvrikunamv, klai ngonu hinlakaala rilajuka, nonugv lokv yvv akonvka hoogv milv kunam doonu vnam anga paama nvgoka kaama dubv. <verse eid="HEB 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2"/>Bunugv rinam apiabv, ngonuka Alvnv Yunying nga tvvpv kunv. Bunu doin ha tvvtoku, vbvritola hv bunua oguguka anyung kaama, ogulvgavbolo vdwlo bunu um tvvtokudw, bunu mvngjwng gv lvkobv torwk simato. <verse eid="HEB 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:11">Miri 95:11</ref></char></note>Vbvrikunamv ngonu yvvbunudw mvngjwng dukunv, Pwknvyarnv gv milv kunam doonu nga paadu kunv. So si ninyigv vbv minambv ridu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">“Ngo haachila okv milvnam go mintoku:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:3">‘Ngoogv bunua doonu modubv mooku jinamlo bunu vdwloka aalamare!’”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:3">Nw gv nyiamooku ha pwklinyarlin rilokv ninyigv kudungkua nga rime ropv tvlaka nw sum mintoku. <verse eid="HEB 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:2">Atk 2:2</ref></char></note>Darwknv kitap gv kvgonvlo so si alu kanw nvnvgv lvkwng nga mindu: “Alu kanw nvnvlo Pwknvyarnv ninyigv kudungkua mvnwngnga riku mabv doonu toku.” <verse eid="HEB 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:11">Miri 95:11</ref></char></note> Lvkodv so gv gaam akin sum mindvto: “Ngoogv bunua doonu modubv jinam mookulo bunu vdwloka aanyumare.” <verse eid="HEB 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6"/>Yvv bunu Alvnv Yunying nga tvvchonv vdwv ho doonu nama paamato, ogulvgavbolo bunu mvngjwng mato. Vbvrikunamv hokaka kvvbi vdwa um paamu namvka doodu. <verse eid="HEB 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:7">Miri 95:7</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 95:8">8</ref></char></note> So si Pwknvyarnv kvvbi alu yago mvpv pvku, so si “silu” vnammv si jvjv ngv. Achialvnv anying gv kochinglo nw Dabid gvlokv mintoku Darwknv kitaplo sum lvkpvdoku:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:7">“Silu nonu Pwknvyarnv gv vlv nga tvvpa pvbolo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:7">vlwnghapok bv riyoka.”<verse eid="HEB 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 31:7">Det 31:7</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 22:4">Js 22:4</ref></char>
    </note>Josua Pwknvyarnv gv milv kunam doonu vnama nyi vdwa jiro nvgoilo, Pwknvyarnv koching soka kvvbi alu gv lvkwngbv mima dvnvpvi. <verse eid="HEB 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9"/>Pwknvyarnv alu kanw nvnvlo doonu toku vkv aingbv so si Pwknvyarnv gv nyi vdwgv lvgabv doonu go doobwng dunv. <verse eid="HEB 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:2">Atk 2:2</ref></char></note>Yvv bunu Pwknvyarnv gv milv kunam doonu ha naarwksipv kunv ninyigv doonunam aingbv bunugv kudungkua lokv doonu nyadu kunv. <verse eid="HEB 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11"/>Vbvrikunamv, klai ngonu ngonugv lvgvlvma lokv ho gv doonu nama naarwksinam lvgabv rikwlaju, vkvlvgavbolo bunugv mvngjwng manam lokv naarwk sinyu mato vkv aingbv ngonu gvlo yvv akonvka naarwk sinyu manamgo kaama dubv. <verse eid="HEB 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12"/>Pwknvyarnv gv gamchar hv turnv okv kudungkua ridu, Riokse tagotaksak bv arik nvngaka rippu yanv. Si yalu gvla dow gv gvvkiap sikua, loobung gvla lochin gv geekiap sikua peepwk nyuladu. Si haapok gv mvngjimvngro la mvngnam ha jwngkadaka dunv. <verse eid="HEB 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13"/>Pwknvyarnvnyi kaapa moma dubv ogugoka vvsivrum sego yikungyira kaama; pwknamyarnam mvnwngngv ninyigv nyik kaagia lo kaadatara dubv ridunv . Okv ngonu alu gunyi ngonu atuv turla singrilo ogugo ripvdopv kudw ho mvnwngnga sapkumla ninyia kaatam dukubv rirung reku.<verse eid="HEB 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Kairungnv Nyibu Butvyachoknv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14"/>Vbvrikunamv klai ngonu ngonugv mvngjwng nama haatin yayabv rilaju. Ogulvgavbolo ngonu Kaiyachoknv Butvyachok go doodu, nw Jisu Pwknvyarnv gv Kuunyilo ngv, nw Pwknvyarnv gv dooku nvchilo vnglwkroku. <verse eid="HEB 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15"/>Ngonugv nyibu Butvyachok angv ngonugv lvvku marinyi aya mvngpa manyunv gubv rima. Vbvmabvdv ngonua rinam apiabv ngonugv Butvyachoknyi lamtv mvnwnglo pokayarka toku, vbvritola nw rimur go rimato. <verse eid="HEB 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16"/>Vbvrikunamv, klvi ngonu mvngjwngjwngrw laju, okv Pwknvyarnv gv doginglo aanwk laju, ogolo aya doodudw. Hoka ngonu aya nga naarwk sire okv vdwlo dinchikochi ridw ngonua ridurdubv anyuaya nga paayare.<verse eid="HEB 4:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1"/>Butvyachokbv rinv dvdv nga ninyigv nyibu ajin vdwgv aralokv dargvrila okv bunugv amin bv Pwknvyarnv gv kudungkua nga riya modubv, okv erinpeelwk yadubv okv rimur vdwgv lvgabv erinpeelwk la riyamodubv mvgvdvnam hv. <verse eid="HEB 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2"/>Nw atubongvka lvvkumanv gubv rijeka, nyi rimurnv okv chimapamunv vdwgvbv damdvyanv gubv rilare. <verse eid="HEB 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 9:7">Leb 9:7</ref></char></note>Ogulvgavbolo nw atubongvka lvvkumanv gubv ridu vkvlvgabv nw nyi vdwgv rimur lvgabv erinpeelwk mwngmare, vbvritola nw atubogv rimur lvgabvka rire. <verse eid="HEB 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 9:7">Leb 9:7</ref></char></note>Yvvka atubongv mvngdv rungnam Butvyachok gubv ridubv vla darsu madunv. So si Aaronnyi mvnam aingbv—Pwknvyarnv gv goknam nyi anga mwng Butvyachok gubv mvdunv.<verse eid="HEB 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Miri 2:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ho apiabv Kristo nw atubongv mvngdv rungnam Butvyachok gubv mvsu mapvnv. Vmabvya, Pwknvyarnv ninyia mintoku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:5">“No ngoogv Kuunyilo ngv;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:5">silu ngo noogv Abu bv ripvku.”<verse eid="HEB 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:4">Miri 110:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Nw kvvbi gunv loka vbv mintato,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">“Melkijedek <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Melkijedek gv nyibu bulilo; </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Melijedek jebv; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Melkijedek gv ritungnga risetsvnm.</char></note>gv nyibu buli lokv,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:6">no dvbvsingtambv nyibu akobv ribwngre.”<verse eid="HEB 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mt 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mk 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Lk 22:39-46</ref></char>
    </note>Jisu nw gv Sichingmooku so ririlo ninyia rimu mabv ringji bongv Pwknvyarnvnyi, gamtv rungbv okv nyikla sarla lvbula kumto. Ogulvgavbolo nw nyaknyi nvgo okv dinchikochi nvgo vbvrikulokv Pwknvyarnv ninyia tvvtoku. <verse eid="HEB 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8"/>Vbvritola nw Pwknvyarnv gv Kuunyilo bv rito laka nwgv hinching chingku lokv mingkulo vngnam ha chintoku. <verse eid="HEB 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9"/>Vdwlo ninyia rilakriku nvgobv mvtokudw, nw ninyigv minamha tvvnv vdwgv lvgabv turbwngnv ringlinbaanam gv kolv gubv ritoku, <verse eid="HEB 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10"/>okv Pwknvyarnv ninyia Melkijedek gv nyibu buli lokv nyibu Butvyachok gubv mvtoku.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Melkijedek gv nyibu bulilo; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Melijedek jebv; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Melkijedek gv ritungnga risetsvnm</char></note><verse eid="HEB 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mvngjwng nga topunv vdwa gamrwnam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11"/>So gv lvkwng nga minse ngv aigo doodu, vbvritola si nonua minbwk jidubv minla madu, ogulvgavbolo nonu chingtwng madu. <verse eid="HEB 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12,13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:2">1Kor 3:2</ref></char></note> (Nonua tamsar dubv dw ngv nonugv lvgabv mego vngtoku.) Nonuno tamsarnvgobv ridukubv dw ngv achialv tuku—vjvlodvbv nonu Pwknvyarnv gv doin mincho jinam ha kvvbi gunv nonua tamsar dvdubv ribwngdo. Achin chimpw nga dvku svnga nonu vjaklodvbv achu tvngdubv ridu. <verse eid="HEB 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13"/>Yvvdw achu tvngdunv hv vjaklodvbv anga ngv, alv poma gv lvkwng nga hingkwkaakw manvngv. <verse eid="HEB 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14"/>Achin chimpw si minbolo nyi kaikunv vdwgv, yvvbunudw risarvngsar silaikula alvnvnga la okv alvmanv nga chinlakunv.<verse eid="HEB 5:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1"/>Vbvrikunamv, kvvlo gv kristan doin tvvcho nama ngonugv kochinglo kayu gvrila kaiyayabv chinlvpalv yanamlo vnglv yalaju. Ngonu anyung kaamanv kudungkua nga kayu nama okv Pwknvyarnvnyi mvngjwng kunam a; <verse eid="HEB 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2"/>baptisma <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">baptisma; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">darpudubv kumnam</char></note>gv lvkwng nga tamsarnam okv laak iponam gv lvkwng nga tamsarnam; sinv gv turkurkunam gv lvkwng nga tamsarnam okv dvbvsingtambv jwkadakanam lvkwng nga tamsarnam; ho minam mvnwngnga naalaila ngonu anw lvngtung go mvrung kumare. <verse eid="HEB 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3"/>Pwknvyarnv ngonua rila dubv jibolo, ngonu vbv rirungreku, klai ngonu vnglv lakuju!<verse eid="HEB 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4"/>Vkvlvgabv yvvbunudw bunugv mvngjwng nga kayu pvkudw bunua oguaingbv lvkodv mvngdin modukubv naakur nyureku? Bunu Pwknvyarnv gv lounglo lvko dookwkunv; bunu nyidomooku gv amin jinam ha dvkw kunv okv Darwknv Dow gv baag jinam ha naarwk sika kunv; <verse eid="HEB 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5"/>bunu Pwknvyarnv gv gamchar hv alvnv vla rikadokala chimpvkunv okv aainvgv dw gv jwkrw ha himpa toku. <verse eid="HEB 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6"/>Okv ho kochingbv bunu bunugv mvngjwng nga kayu roku! bunua lvkodv naakur lakula mvngdin modukubv rinyukuma namgo, ogulvgavbolo bunu Pwknvyarnv gv Kuunyilo nga lvkodv daapo lo takki duku okv nyi mvnwng gv kaagialo hinying modu.<verse eid="HEB 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7"/>Pwknvyarnv kvdw nga bokta lwkjila hvkvgv aolo nyido holunam dvdv nga tvngmula okv yvvdw um rongo mvlwkla mvria dunv hvkvgv lvgabv anyung doomu dubv nvmwng nga boklin jimudu. <verse eid="HEB 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:17">Atk 3:17</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 3:18">18</ref></char></note>Vbvritola hv tvv okv nvmwng boklin jibolo, hv ogu anyung kaakumanv; hv Pwknvyarnv gv beenam gubvrila maatarbv alvmanv ngv hum vmvbv ramyok riku. <verse eid="HEB 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9"/>Vbvritola ayanam ajin vdwa ngonu svbv minjeka, ngonu nonugv lvkwng nga jvjvbv rirungre vla mvngjwng dunv. Nonugv ringlinbaalin paanam v nonua alvyanv bokta go doodu vla ngonu chindu. <verse eid="HEB 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10"/>Pwknvyarnv mvngkiammvngriam manv ngv. Nw nonugv kudungkua rinam ha vmalo ridur gvrila ninyia paknam ha kaatam nama okv vjak kvvbi kristan vdwa jibwng nama vdwloka mvngpa mabv rimare. <verse eid="HEB 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11"/>Ngonugv kaibv mvngjimvngro namv nonugv dinchibv mvnggap nama ataranya alu lobv rilin laka vbvribolo nonugv mvngtin namv jvjv nvgobv rilin jiriku. <verse eid="HEB 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12"/>Ngonu nonua sepelakre nvgobv rima svgo vla mvngdunv, vbvritola mvngjwng yala okv saktvnv vdwgv aingbv risego vla, okv vbvrila Pwknvyarnv gv milv nama naarwksinv gubv risego vla mvngdunv.<verse eid="HEB 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pwknvyarnv gv jvjv rungbv milv kunam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13"/>Vdwlo Pwknvyarnv Abrahamnyi milv tokudw, nw ninyigv milv nama rirungre vla milvla mintoku. Ninyia kaiyanv kaamanam lvgabv, vdwlo nw milv tokudw nw atugv gv amin lokv minvla milv toku. <verse eid="HEB 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:16">Atk 22:16</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 22:17">17</ref></char></note>Nw minto, “Ngo milvdunv nam ngo boktalwkjire okv achialvbv kuu husi doolin more,” <verse eid="HEB 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15"/>Abraham saktv nvgobv rito, okv vkvlvgabv nw Pwknvyarnv gv milv nama paatoku. <verse eid="HEB 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16"/>Vdwlo ngonu milvnam go minredw, ngonu ngonua kaiyanv akogv amin lokv milv nvdu vbv milv kolokv larmi sunama minjup dunv. <verse eid="HEB 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17"/>Pwknvyarnv gv milv kunam a naarwk sijinv vdwa, Pwknvyarnv nwgv ridubv mvngnam a um vdwloka mvkumv madunv vla minbwk jidubv mvngdu; vkvlvgabv hv nwgv milv kunamlo akodv milvnamgo mintam lwkdvdu. <verse eid="HEB 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18"/>Vbvrikunamv, Pwknvyarnv gvlo so baanyi si doodunv hv nw mvvla manammv okv akuav nyuma namv. Vkvlvgabv ngonu nw gvlo ringria nama paanv vdwv ngonugv kaagialo mvngtin pvvji nama hvngdwngrungbv gaktwkkvrwk ladubv kairungnv mintvmiru ha jidu. <verse eid="HEB 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:2">Leb 16:2</ref></char></note>Ngonugv mvngtin v ngonugv singnam lvgabv svbv toochi jvbv rila doodunv. Sum ogugoka rika nyumare, okv nyidomooku tologv pwknvyarnvnaam arwng gv vji torpin sinam a vngpik laila Darwkyachok kolo vnglwkre. <verse eid="HEB 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Miri 110:4</ref></char></note>Ngonu gvbv Jisu ngonua vngchoyala hoka vnglwktoku okv dvbvsingtam lvgabv, Melkijedek gv nyibu butung bv Butvyachok nvgobv ripvkunv. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:20 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Melkijedek gv nyibu buli lokv </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(Katoka 5.6)</char></note><verse eid="HEB 6:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7"/>
  <para style="s">Nyibu Melkijedek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 14:17-20">Atk 14:17-20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>So gv Melkijedek vnam nyi angv si Salem gv dvbv ngv okv Kaiyachoknv Pwknvyarnv gv nyibuv. Abraham gv dvbv apiha nyimak mvyayala aakur rikulo, Melkijedek ninyia kaarwksuto okv boktalwkji toku, <verse eid="HEB 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2"/>Abraham nyimak pakulo vdwgo yikungyira naakum pvkudw mvnwng lokv vring lokv akin gonyi ninyia jitoku. (Melkijedek gv aminv mintubv minchonam angv “Darwkchongchongnv Dvbv” vla minamv; ogulvgavbolo nw Salem gv dvbv bv rinam lvgabv nw gv aminv “Sarsopoyonv Dvbv” vla minta namv) <verse eid="HEB 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3"/>Melkijedek gv abuv vmalo anv ngv vmalo nw gv abuapa vdwa yvvnyika lvkgapla vvpvnamgo kaama; ninyia bvnglin nama vmalo ninyigv sinam a lvkgap pvvnamgo kaama. Nw Pwknvyarnv gv Kuunyilo aingnv; nw dvbvsingtambv nyibubv rila doobwngnv.<verse eid="HEB 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4"/>Vbvrikunamv, nonu kaatoka, nw achialvbv kainvgo. Ngonugv yunam abuapa Abraham nw gv nyimaklo paanam ogumvnwng loka vring lokv akin gonyi ninyia jitoku. <verse eid="HEB 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:21">Num 18:21</ref></char></note> Okv Lebi gv husi nyibubv rinv vdwa, bunuka Abraham gv Husi bv rikujeka, Pvbv lo bunugv Israel nyi vdwgvlo vring lokv akonyi naakum yadubv minto. <verse eid="HEB 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6"/>Melkijedek Lebi gvlokv linvma, vbvritola nw Pwknvyarnv gvlokv milvkunam paanv Abraham gvlokv vring lokv akonyi naakum yatoku, okv ninyia boktalwkji toku. <verse eid="HEB 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7"/>Boktalwkji nama paanv amam svnga, jinv angv kaiyadunv, ho lvkwngbv ogu mvngngum sego kaama. <verse eid="HEB 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8"/>Darwknv Kitaplo minam apiabv, nyibu vdwa minrinyi yvvbunudw vring loka akin gonyi naanv vdwv sijikunv vdwv; vbvritola Melkijedek gvbv minrinyi vring loka akin gonyi naanv si turnv angv. <verse eid="HEB 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9"/>Okv, vbvka minlado, Abraham vring lokv akin a jitoku, Lebi (Ho gv husi vdwv vring loka akin gonyi naakumyanv) jita toku. <verse eid="HEB 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10"/>Vdwlo Abraham Melkijedeknyi kaarwksitokudw Lebinyi ho bvngtv madvto, nw ninyigv abuapa Abraham gv ayak lo doomwngto.<verse eid="HEB 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11"/>Lebi vdwgv nyibu buli lokv Israel nyi vdwa Pvbv nga jitoku. Vjak, Lebi vdw gvlokv nyibubv rila rinamlo jvjvbv rvbwng nvgobolo, hv Aaron gvbv mimabv, Pvbv gv lvlam ha manv Melkijedek <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Melkijedek gv nyibu buli lokv</char><char style="ft" closed="false">(Katoka 5.6)</char></note>gv buli lokv angusinv nvgwngnv nyibu go kaatamla daklwk dubv dinchi madunvpv. <verse eid="HEB 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12"/>Ogulvgavbolo vdwlo nyibu buli a mvkupmv rikudw, hoka Pvbv loka mvkupmv dukubv ridu kunv. <verse eid="HEB 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13"/>Okv ngonugv Ahtu, vla minggvdvnam si, aku sinv haalung lokv, okv ninyigv haalung lokv vdwloka yvvka nyibubv rikama. <verse eid="HEB 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14"/>Vkvlvgabv mvnwngngv alvyaungbv chindu, ninyia Juda gv haalung lokv bvnglin kunamv; okv vdwlo Moses nyibugv lvkwng nga minkubvdw nw so gv haalung sum minpa mato.<verse eid="HEB 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Melkijedek aingnv kvvbi nyibu ako</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15"/>Melkijedek aingnv kvvbi nyibu go aalwk kunamv, gaamv maataryajebv minpok yaya duku. <verse eid="HEB 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16"/>Ninyia nyibubv mvtoku, hv nyia nyi gv pvbv lokv mvma, vbvritola dvbvsvngtambv turnam gv jwkrw lokv mvpvkunv. <verse eid="HEB 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Miri 110:4</ref></char></note>Vkvlvga Darwknv kitaplo mindu, “Melkijedek<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Melkijedek gv nyibu buli lokv </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(Katoka 5.6)</char></note> gv nyibu buli lokv no dvbvsvngtambv nyibubv rire.” <verse eid="HEB 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18"/>Vbvrikunamv, kvvlo gv pvbv nga kayutvkula, ogulvgavbolo hv lvvkumanam bv rito okv anyung kaaku matoku. <verse eid="HEB 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19"/>Vkvlvga Moses gv pvbv ngv ogumvnwng nga rvbwngching bv mvla gvmato. Okv vjak ngonugv Pwknvyarnvnyi nvchi ladukubv alvyanv mvngtin ha jipvku. <verse eid="HEB 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20"/>Okv ho gv aolo hoka Pwknvyarnv gv milv kunam go doodvdo. Dvbv ha nyibubv mvri hoka svkvnv milvnam go kaamato. <verse eid="HEB 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Miri 110:4</ref></char></note>Vbvritola, vdwlo Pwknvyarnv ninyia svbv milvto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">“Ahtu dinchinv milv kunam go mintoku</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:21">okv um naakur kumare:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">‘No dvbvsingtambv nyibubv rire,’” vbv milvla mingkunam lokv Jisu nyibubv ritoku.<verse eid="HEB 7:21"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22"/>Vbvrikunamv, so gv aku sunam si Jisunyi alvyanv milv kunamgv minchar kunam gubv mvtoku.<verse eid="HEB 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23"/>Hoka akusunam akodv doodvdo: hoka kvvbi nyibu vkv achialvgo doonyato, bunu sinya lakula kudungkua nga ribwng nyuma toku. <verse eid="HEB 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24"/>Vbvritola Jisu dvbvsingtambv torbwngdu, okv nwgv nyibubv rila kudungkua nga yvvnyika jisik sima. <verse eid="HEB 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25"/>Okv vkvlvgabv nw rilanv, vjakka okv alu gv dwkia yvvbunudw nwgv lokv Pwknvyarnv gvlo aadunv nw ho vdwgv lvgabv Pwknvyarnvnyi kumbv jire ogulvgavbolo nw dvbvsvngtambv turbwng nvngvku.<verse eid="HEB 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26"/>Vbvrikunamv, Jisu nw ngonugv dinchi nama kaaji kunv Butvyachok hv. Nw darwknv; nw rigakpanam go kaama vmalo ninyi gvlo rimur kaama; nw rimurnv vdw gvlokv akusubv rikunv okv nyido mookugv aolo naacha kunam angv. <verse eid="HEB 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 9:7">Leb 9:7</ref></char></note>Nw kvvbi Butvyachok apiabv rimanv; nw alu gv dwkia nw gv rimur lvgabv erinpeelwk rinchola okv ho kochingbv nyi vdwgv rimur haka erinpeelwk ria jila rikwng svgo kaama. Nw vdwlo atubongv erinpeelwk subvdw lvkinlo dvbvsingtam gv lvgabv erinpeelwkla ria jitoku. <verse eid="HEB 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28"/>Moses gv Pvbv lokv nyi Butvyachok bv ribwk manv nga dartoku; vbvritola, Pwknvyarnv gv milv ngv um kaiyago milv kunam lokv, Pvbv gv kochingbv aanv milv kunam lokv Kuunyilo nga dartoku, ninyia dvbvsingtam gv lvgabv rilak nvgobv mvtoku.<verse eid="HEB 7:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8"/>
  <para style="s">Jisu ngonugv Butvyachoknv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Miri 110:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ngonugv minggvdvnam mvnwng so gv anyung ngv ngonu svkvnv Butvyachok go doodu, nw nyidomooku tologv Darwkrungnv Dvbv dooging gv lakbik tangvlo doodu. <verse eid="HEB 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2"/>Nw nyi gv laak lokv mvmanam vbvritola Ahtu gv mvkunam jvjvnv tombu gv Darwkyachok kolo Butvyachok gubvrila riria jidu.<verse eid="HEB 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3"/>Butvyachok dvdv ngv Pwknvyarnvnyi svnwngsvmin erinpeelwk yadubv tolwkkunam vdwv, okv vkvlvgabv ngonugv Butvyachok hvka erinpeelwk jirungdubv ogugo doorungre. <verse eid="HEB 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4"/>Nw sichingmooku so rinv guibolo nw nyibu gubv rima rungre, ogulvgavbolo Jius vdwgv Pvbv lo dinchinv amin jinam vdwa erinpeelwk yajinv nyibu vdwv doonyado. <verse eid="HEB 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:40">Mog 25:40</ref></char></note>Bunugv nyibubv rila ridungripa rinam mv jvjvbv nyido tolokv rinam am riringrima riala rinam go. Vbvdvdvbv Moses nyika ritoku. Vdwlo nw darwknv Tombu nga mvtv tvvtokudw, Pwknvyarnv ninyia minto, “Moodw tolo nam kaatam kunam ho gv alambv ogumvnwng nga no mvrung tvlaka.” <verse eid="HEB 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6"/>Vbvritola vjak, Jisunyi nyibugv kudungkua nga bunua kaiyanv gubv jipvku, Pwknvyarnv gvla ninyigv nyi vdwgv pingkolo nw gv milv minsu dubv mvpvripv kunam angv alvyanv go hvkv aingbv, ogulvgavbolo so si alvnv oguogu gv lvgabv milv kunamlo minggingdo.<verse eid="HEB 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7"/>Milv lvcho kunam ho mimurnam oguogua kaama bolo, lvnyi nvbv milv nga dinchi madunvpv. <verse eid="HEB 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8-12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:40">Mog 25:40</ref></char></note> Vbvritola Pwknvyarnv ninyigv nyi vdwgvlo rimur go paalaku nw vbv minto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">“Ahtu mindu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:8">ngoogv Israel gv nyi vdwala okv Juda gv nyi vdwa anw bv milv minsudw gv alu vdwv aariku.<verse eid="HEB 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9"/>So gv milv minsu jinam si ngoogv bunugv abuapa vdwa ngoogv laak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">lokv gakbwngla Ijipt loka linggv rilo milv kunam ayumbv bv rimare.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">Bunu ngoogv bunua lvkobv milv kunam a bunu jwkjwkvrwk nyakuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">okv vkvlvgabv ngo bunua tvvria kaaria kuma.<verse eid="HEB 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10"/>Ahtu mindu, vjak aarinv alu tolo so gv milv kunam sum ngo Israel gv</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">nyi vdwgv lvkobv mvreku:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Ngo bunugv mongrumara lo ngoogv pvbv nga lwkre</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">okv bunugv haapok vdwlo lvklwk re.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Ngo bunugv Pwknvyarnvbv rire,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">okv bunu ngoogv nyi bv rireku.<verse eid="HEB 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11"/>‘Ahtunyi chinlakv’ vla yvvka bunugv ajin vdwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">vmalo namrwk vdwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">tamsar sego kaamare.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">Ogulvgavbolo bunu mvnwngngv nga chinreku</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">miangyachok lokv naalaila kaiyachok lobv.<verse eid="HEB 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12"/>Ngo bunugv rimur vdwa mvngnga jireku</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:12">okv bunugv rigakpanam vdwaka mvngpa kumare.”<verse eid="HEB 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13"/>Anw bv milv kunamgv lvgabv minla, Pwknvyarnv minchola milv kunam anga akuaram motoku; okv ogu oguv akukunv okv ainapin kunvngv baapubv nyeedukunv.<verse eid="HEB 8:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9"/>
  <para style="s">Sichingmooku okv Nyidomooku gv Kumnamjonam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1"/>Milv chonam angv kumnamjonam lvgabv pvbv ngv doosuto okv kumnamjonam lvgabv nyi gv mvnam kumkujoku hvka dootoku. <verse eid="HEB 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:1-30">Mog 26:1-30</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 25:31-40">Mog 25:31-40</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 25:23-30">Mog 25:23-30</ref></char></note>Tombu nga mvtoku, agum ya gv angv Darwknv karchung vla minto, hoka mvdurvpum tongianvnv ngv okv tvbul vla Pwknvyarnv gvlo kumlwk kunam vtwng ngv dooto. <verse eid="HEB 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Mog 26:31-33</ref></char></note>Anyinvbv vji torpin nvnvgv koching gv Tombu hum Darwkyachoknv karchung vla mintoku. <verse eid="HEB 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:1-6">Mog 30:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 25:10-16">Mog 25:10-16</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 16:33">Mog 16:33</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 17:8-10">Num 17:8-10</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 25:16">Mog 25:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 10:3-5">Det 10:3-5</ref></char></note>Ho hoka nampunv mwkwmwa mwwku ain yugwng ngv dooto, okv hoka ain taktwng lo Manna ngv dootola, Aaron gv bangngi ngv anv vkv harlin tvla, okv vlwng lvngtak taknyi gulo gamki nama lvktokula, ho mvnwngngv ain lokv mvrum kunam Milvkunam Jampa gv arwnglo dootoku. <verse eid="HEB 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:18-22">Mog 25:18-22</ref></char></note>Jampa gv aolo cherubim vdwv dooto hvbv mvnam hv Pwknvyarnv svbv dooming gvdunv vnammv, bunugv laap lokv rimur vdwa mvngnga jiku hum lapyum toku. Vbvritola vjak ogumvnwngnga mingkimio la mindw ngema.<verse eid="HEB 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 18:2-6">Num 18:2-6</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Svkvbv ho gv yikungyira vdwa mvkimvak pvvtoku. Nyibu vdwv agum yangv gv Tombu lo bunugv ridungripa nga ridubv alu gv dwkia hoka aakito, <verse eid="HEB 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:2-34">Leb 16:2-34</ref></char></note>vbvritola Butvyachok mvngchik Tombu gv arwng yalo aaladunv, okv nw vbv anying nga lvkin go aadunv. Nw hoka nw gvla nyi vdwgv chimabv rimur kunamgv rimur vdwgv lvkwngbv Pwknvyarnvnyi jidubv oyi ha bvngla yila aadunv. <verse eid="HEB 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8"/>So gv mvkimvakpvnam mvnwng lokv Darwknv Dow ngv rvbwngbv minbwk jido agum gv Tombu ngv doobwng dvdv redw arwng gv Darwk yachokku lamtv nga mvkok jimato. <verse eid="HEB 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9"/>Si vjakgv dw gv lvgabv kaaring sise go. So gv minam si Pwknvyarnvnyi daan jinam okv svnwngsvmin erinpeelwk jinam vdw si kumnvjonv nyi vdwgv haapok ka jvjv rvbwng dukubv mvnyu mare vnammv, <verse eid="HEB 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10"/>ogulvgavbolo bunu dvnam, tvngnam, okv aku-aku sinv aba lokv darkak sudubv rito. So mvnwng si agum lo kaatamnam pvbv ngv, Pwknvyarnv gv anw bv pvbv mvlinrilin ma dvdvlobv si pvbv doobwngre.<verse eid="HEB 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11"/>Vbvritola so alvnv oguogu doonv vdwgv Butvyachok gubv Kristo rila aapv kunv.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:11</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Si doopvku; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitap lo doodu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">aadungo</char></note> Nw gv kudungkuariku tombu ngv kai yado okv rvbwngchingka yado; so gv tombu si nyi laak lokv mvma namv, hv mannv, si pwknamyarnam nyia mooku so gv aba gunvma. <verse eid="HEB 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12"/>Vdwlo Kristo Tombu lo vngtokudw okv lvkin lo dvbvsingtam lvgabv Darwkyachok kolo aarinyi nw yabin okv svv gv oyi bvngla yila erinpeelwk dubv aamato; vmabvya, nw ngonugv lvgabv turbwngnv ringlinbaalin ha naaji tvibv atubogv oyi ha bvngla aayato. <verse eid="HEB 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:15">Leb 16:15</ref>,<ref loc="LEV 16:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 19:9">Num 19:9</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 19:17-19">17-19</ref></char></note>Yabin vdwgv okv svv vdwgv oyi hv okv svvkuu ramyok namgv mvchu ha arwanyunv nyi vdwa paksak rinyi, okv hv bunua arwanyula darwkmanv nga naa jilaku darwk dukubv mvdukunv. <verse eid="HEB 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14"/>Si jvjv ngv, vkvlvgabv Kristo gv oyi lokv sum kaiyago darwkdubv mvla dunv! turbwngnv Dow lokv nw atubongv Pwknvyarnv gvlo rvbwngchingnv erinpeelwk gubv rinlwk sitoku. Ngonu turnv Pwknvyarnvnyi riji ladukubv nw gv oyi hv ngonugv mongrumara lo arwanyu anyung kaama nvnga darwk dukubv mvreku.<verse eid="HEB 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15"/>So lvkwngbv Kristo anw bv milv kunam a mvkimvak kunv angv, vkvlvgavbolo Pwknvyarnv gv goknam vdwv Pwknvyarnv gv milv kunam doobwngnv bokta nga naarwk silare. Milv lvcho nama rigvrilo nyi mvnwngngv rigakpatoku okv bunua naalin dukubv nyi ako sitoku vkvlvgabv hum rila toku. <verse eid="HEB 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16"/>Seennyilen gaam lvkwngnga minbolo, milvkunv angv siro pvku vla kaatam rungdukubv rirung dukunv, <verse eid="HEB 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17"/>seen gaam minv nyi angv turdubolo, seen gaam hv ogu anyung kaama, siro kubolo ho kochingbv anyung dooreku. <verse eid="HEB 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18"/>Vkvlvkwngbv milv <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:18 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">milvnam: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Grik lo gamchar akin si manv “mvngnam” okv “milvnam</char></note>chonam angv oyi lokv mwng rinv nvla ripv kunv. <verse eid="HEB 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:19,20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:6-8">Mog 24:6-8</ref></char></note>Moses Pvbv lo gamkinam gaam mvnwngnga nyi vdwa japtam jichoto. Vbvrikunamv nw svv okv yabin oyi ha naala isi mvyo tvla tajar svngkio okv svlar amw tanu yalwng dubv mvnam ha rinvnvla Pvbv kitap hala okv nyi mvnwngnga paksak toku. <verse eid="HEB 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20"/>Nw minto, “So oyi si Pwknvyarnv gv nonua gamki nama tvvla rilakv vla milv nama mvu pvvnam hv.” <verse eid="HEB 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 8:15">Leb 8:15</ref></char></note> Vbvdvdvbv Moses ka Darwknv Tombu hala okv kumnvjonvnv yikungyira vdwa oyi paksak toku. <verse eid="HEB 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 17:11">Leb 17:11</ref></char></note>Rinam gvbv, Pvbv gv milam lokv kaarinyi ogumvnwng nga oyi lokv mvdar ridar toku, okv oyi lokv rimur ha mvngnga mwngtoku.<verse eid="HEB 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kristo gv sinamv rimur ha mva toku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23"/>So oguogu vdw si nyidomooku tolokv doolin sinv jvjvnv oguogu nga mvringmvma namv vbv mvkakrikak dubv ritoku. Vbvritola nyidomookugv oguogu ngv um alvyabv erinpeelwk jidubv ritoku. <verse eid="HEB 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24"/>Ogulvgavbolo Kristo nwgv laak lokv mvnam Darwknv karchung lo aamato, hv nyidomooku tologv jvjv nvnga mvringmvma la mvnam hv. Nw nyidomooku tolo dadi chatoku, vjak nw ngonugv lvgabv Pwknvyarnv gv kaagialo dakdunv. <verse eid="HEB 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25"/>Jius nyi vdwgv Butvyachok angv anying dwkia svnwngsvmin oyi ha bvngla yila Darwkyachoknv karchunglo aakito. Vbvritola Kristo atubongv erinpeelwk tvbv hoka aakimato, <verse eid="HEB 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26"/>Ogulvgavbolo nyiamooku ha pwklinyarlin rilokv nw hindv-hindv la awgo hirukaya nga hindubv rire. Vmabvya, vjak vdwlo dw mvnwngngv nyeedu kubv nvchi tokudw nw lvkin lo dvbvsingtam lvgabv aatoku, nyia nyi gv rimur a naa jidukubv nw atubongv erinpeelwk jitoku. <verse eid="HEB 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27"/>Nyi mvnwngngv lvko sirungre okv ho kochingbv Pwknvyarnvnyi jwngkadaka koreku. <verse eid="HEB 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Aij 53:12</ref></char></note> Vbvdvdvbv Kristo mvnwng gv rimur lvgabv lvkin gubv erinpeelwk jila ria jipvkunv. Nw lvkodv aareku rimur ha naa dubvma, vbvritola yvvbunudw ninyia kaayala doodunv bunua ringdubaadu kubv.<verse eid="HEB 9:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1"/>Jius vdwgv Pvbv ngv ogumvnwng mangv okv jwkjwkvrwk bv jvjvnv oguogua mvring namv; Si aainv alvjvnv oguogu ngam mvringla mvnam vmwng. Anying-anying nga erinpeelwk rinam akin a ribwngla, dvbvsvngtambv rinji bwngdu. Vbvrinamv oguaingbv Pvbv lo erinpeelwkku lokv Pwknvyarnv gvlo aanv nyi vdwa rvbwngching nvgobv mvnyu dubv? <verse eid="HEB 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2"/>Nyi vdwv Pwknvyarnvnyi kumnamjonam lokv rimur aje nga jvjvbv darwk dubv mvpvkubolo, bunu rigakpala rimurnv gubv lvkodv hinsu mare, okv erinpeelwknam mvnwngngv riku mare. <verse eid="HEB 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3"/>So si vbvridu anying-anying nga erinpeelwknam si nyi vdwa bunugv rimur vdwa mvngpa modubv. <verse eid="HEB 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4"/>Ogulvgavbolo svv gvla yabin gv oyi hv vdwloka rimur vdwa naa nyula madu. <verse eid="HEB 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5-7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 40:6-8">Miri 40:6-8</ref></char></note>Vkvlvgabv so gv lvkwngbv, vdwlo Kristo nyiamooku so itv tvvriha nw Pwknvyarnvnyi minto:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">“No erinpeelwk jinama okv daan jinam vdwa mvngmadu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:5">vbvritola no ngoogv lvgabv ayak amar ha mvpvripv jipv.<verse eid="HEB 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6"/>No svnwngsvmin ha apwbv yugwnglo ramji nama vmalo rimur</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:6">vdwa erinpeelwkla ria jinam ham mvngpu mado.<verse eid="HEB 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7"/>Vbvrikunamv ngo mintoku, ‘Ho Pwknvyarnv,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">ngo sinv, Pvbv kitaplo ngo lvkvng nga lwknam apiabv,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">ngo no gv mvngnam ha ridubv vla si doodunv.’”<verse eid="HEB 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8"/>Nw mincho toku, “No erinpeelwk rijinama okv daan jinam ha vmalo yugwnglo svnwngsvmin ramji nama okv rimur vdwa erinpeelwk nama mvngmado vmalo mvngpuka mado.” Pvbv gv minam lokv soogv erinpeelwknam mvnwngnga ritoku vbvrijvka nw svbv minto. <verse eid="HEB 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9"/>Vbvrikunamv nw mintoku, “O Pwknvyarnv, noogv mvngnam a ridubv vla, ngo si doopvnv.” Vkvlvgabv Pwknvyarnv kvvlo gv erinpeelwknam mvnwngnga mva tokula okv hoka Kristo gv erinpeelwk nama mvlwk yapvkunv. <verse eid="HEB 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10"/>Ogulvgavbolo Jisu Kristo Pwknvyarnv ninyia vbv risego vla mvngnama nw ritoku, nw gv ayakka lvkin lo dvbvsingtam lvgabv erinpeelwk jikulokv ngonu mvnwngngv rimur lokv darwk dukunv.<verse eid="HEB 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 29:38">Mog 29:38</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jius vdwgv nyibu dvdv ngv alu gv dwkia nw gv ridung nga ridu okv erinpeelwknam akin ha rinbwng dvdvdo; vbvritola so gv erinpeelwknam vdwv vdwloka rimur vdwa naa nyula madu. <verse eid="HEB 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12,13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Miri 110:1</ref></char></note>Rigvrila Kristo rimur vdwgv lvgabv akin go erinpeelwk jito, nwgv vbv rinsu namv dvbvsingtam lvgabv doobwngre, vbvrikunamv nw Pwknvyarnv gv lakbik tangvlo doolwk duku. <verse eid="HEB 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13"/>Hoka nw vjak Pwknvyarnv nwgv nyimak vdwa ninyigv lvpa lvkwnglo lvpa daging gubv naalwk ma dvdvlobv doyado. <verse eid="HEB 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14"/>Vbvrikunamv, erinpeelwknam akin lokv, yvv bunua rimur loka darwk dukubv mvkunam vdwa dvbvsingtam gv lvgabv rvbwngching nvgobv mvpvkunv.<verse eid="HEB 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15"/>Okv Darwknv Dow ngv ngonua ninyigv lvkwng nga minjito. Nw minchobv minto,<verse eid="HEB 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 31:33">Jer 31:33</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ahtu mindu, “Aainv alu lo ngo bunua</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">so sibv milv minsureku:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">Ngo bunugv haapok dvdvlo ngoogv pvbv vdwa lwkreku</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">okv bunugv mongrumara dvdvlo lvklwkla vpvreku.”<verse eid="HEB 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 31:34">Jer 31:34</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Okv vbvrikunamv nw mindu, “Ngo bunu vdwgv rimur vdwa okv rinyingriru vdwa vdwloka mvngbwng kumare.” <verse eid="HEB 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18"/>Vkvlvgabv vdwlo so nyi vdwgv rimur vdwa mvngnga rokunamv, rimur vdwa naa dukubv daan jinam angv vdwloka dinchi kuma.<verse eid="HEB 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Klai ngonu Pwknvyarnv gv nvchilo aalaju</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19"/>Vbvrikunamv, ngoogv ajin vdwa, Jisu gv sinam lokv ngonu Darwkyachok kolo aadu kubv ajarabi ha paangam pvkunv. <verse eid="HEB 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20"/>Nw torpin sinvnv vjia—hv ninyigv ayak amar hv ho gv lokv ngonugv lvgabv anwnv okv turnv lamtv go mvkok jipv. <verse eid="HEB 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21"/>Ngonu Pwknvyarnv gv naamha kaaya kunv kairungnv nyibu go doodu. <verse eid="HEB 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 8:30">Leb 8:30</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:25">Eje 36:25</ref></char></note>Vkvlvgabv klai ngonu hindumnv haapok bv okv jvjvnv mvngjwng lokv mvngnying mvngsu haapok ka mvkakrikak tokula okv ayak vdwa darwknv isi lokv harkak tokula Pwknvyarnv gv nvchilo aala kuju. <verse eid="HEB 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23"/>Klai ngonu ngonugv mvngtin kunamlo hvngdwngbv gakbwngchvkwng laju, ogulvgavbolo Pwknvyarnv nw gv milv kunamlo jvjvbv rirungre vla ngonu mvngjwng nyulanv. <verse eid="HEB 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24"/>Klai ngonu akin-akin nam dinchikochi bv mvngmi silaju, akin-akin a ridur minsunam lvgabv pakmi sinam okv alvnama kaatam silaju. <verse eid="HEB 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25"/>Klai ngonu kvvbi vdwgv apiabv rima bvju, ngonugv kaarwk tarwk sibwng nama topu mabvju. Vmabvya ngonu akin-akin ha mintvmiru minsu laju, ogulvgavbolo nonuno chinsudo Ahtu gv aadw Alu hv nvchibv aanwk yaya duku.<verse eid="HEB 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26"/>Vkvlvgabv ngonua jvjv nga chimuro kochingbv, ngonu rimur ha rirung nvpv vla ribwng bolo, ho gv rimur aje nga naa nyulanv erinpeelwk riseyago kaakuma. <verse eid="HEB 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 26:11">Aij 26:11</ref></char></note>Vmabvya, busu rungbv kaaya svngv aainv Jwngkadakadw aluv okv Pwknvyarnv gv nyimak vdwa vmv achialv gukulo ramyok svnga. <verse eid="HEB 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:6">Det 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:15">19:15</ref></char></note>Yvvdw Moses gv Pvbv nga tvvmabv rinv nga jwngkadaka gvrila rimur ha kayatayanv anyi gumalo hum kaiyagobv ribolo ho nyi tvvmanv anga aya mvngpa namgo kaamabv mvki riku. <verse eid="HEB 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Mog 24:8</ref></char></note>Vbvrikunamv, yvvbunudw Pwknvyarnv gv Kuunyilo nga toa laku, Pwknvyarnv gv milv kunam oyi hv bunua rimur loka darwknv gobv mvkakrikak kunvnga miang nvgobv mvnglarila okv Dow gv anyubv aya nga miyakayala rinv nyi ogubv mvreku kudw? Mvngka toka vdwgo mvngchi manam alvmanv mvrit riritla risego nw rilwk sipvku! <verse eid="HEB 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:35">Det 32:35</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:36">Det 32:36</ref></char></note>Ogulvgavbolo, “Ngo mvrwk sire, ngo mvtv ngurvre”; okv vbvka mintato, “Ahtu nw nwgv nyi vdwa jwngkadaka reku,” vla minv anga ngonu chindu. <verse eid="HEB 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31"/>Turbwngnv Pwknvyarnv gv laaklo holwk kunam si achialvbv busu rungnam gubv ridu!<verse eid="HEB 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32"/>Vngnyi kunv anying alu lo oguaingbv nonu ripvdakpv kudw mvngka tokuka. Pwknvyarnv gv loung ngv nonua ungkaro kochingbv, nonu achialvbv hirukaya nga hintoku, rigvrila nonu ho gv hirukaya nga riya yaku matoku. <verse eid="HEB 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33"/>Nonua alu golo nyi vdwgv kaakulo rinyingriru bv rilwkla okv hinying rilwkla ritoku, alu gunv golo kure nonu ho gv hinyinghiru svbv hinv vdwgvlo aapwngla lvkobv reming gvnwng laku mvkimvak pvla dootoku. <verse eid="HEB 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34"/>Nonu patwk tumnam vdwgv hirukaya nga himing gvto, okv vdwlo nonugv yikungyira nga dvrit ropv kudw, nonu ho ngoonam ha mvngpu yala saktv toku, ogulvgavbolo nonu alvyanv okv doobwng jinv yikungyira go ngonu paayadu vla chinsudo. <verse eid="HEB 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35"/>Vbvrikunamv, nonu mvngrw nama nyemu mabvka, ogulvgavbolo hv kairungnv amina lvkobv gvlwkla aadunv. <verse eid="HEB 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36"/>Nonu Pwknvyarnv gv mvnglwkbv rinam lvgabv okv ninyigv milv nama naarwksinam lvgabv saktv yanam hv dinchi dunv. <verse eid="HEB 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:37,38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 2:3">Heb 2:3</ref>,<ref loc="HEB 2:4">4</ref> </char></note>Vkvlvga Darwknv Kitaplo mindu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:37">“Achukgo ayungjvma nga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">yvvdw aadungdunv aare;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">nw ajvamv nvgobv rimare.<verse eid="HEB 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38"/>Ogubv rijeka, ngoogv darwknv nyi vdwv, mvngjwngre okv turreku;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">vbvritola bunugv lokv akonv dakkur kubolo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">ngo bunu gvlo mvngpu kumare.”<verse eid="HEB 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39"/>Ngonu dakkur la okv ngookunv nyi ngvma. Vmabvya, ngonu mvngjwng doonv okv ringnam a paakunv.<verse eid="HEB 10:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11"/>
  <para style="s">Mvngjwng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1"/>Mvngjwng doodubv rinam si ngonugv mvngtin nama paarungre vla mvngnam mv, ngonugv kaapa nyula manam oguogua jvjvbv dorungdunv vla mvngnamv. <verse eid="HEB 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2"/>Krimklu gv nyi vdwv bunugv mvngjwng kolokv Pwknvyarnv gv torwksinama paayatoku.<verse eid="HEB 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 1:1">Atk 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 33:6">Miri 33:6</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 33:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:3">Jn 1:3</ref></char>
    </note>Mvngjwng lokv ngonu chindu Pwknvyarnv gv gamchar lokv chinggodogo nga pwklinyarlin pvnv, vkvlvgavbolo kaapanam vdw si kaapa manam lokv mvlin pvnv. <verse eid="HEB 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:3-10">Atk 4:3-10</ref></char></note> Mvngjwng ngv Abelnyi Kein nyimam svnga alvyabv Pwknvyarnvnyi erinpeelwk jimoto. Ninyigv mvngjwng lokv nw Pwknvyarnv gvlo darwknv nyi gubv torwksinama paayatoku, ogulvgavbolo Pwknvyarnv atubongv ninyigv erinpeelwk jinama torwk sitoku. Abel siro kujeka, ninyigv mvngjwng ngv vjaklodvbv gaam raadungdo.<verse eid="HEB 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 5:21-24">Atk 5:21-24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mvngjwng ngv Enoknyi simu mato. Vmabvya, ninyia Pwknvyarnv gvlo naacha toku, yvvka ninyia mapa matoku, ogulvgavbolo Pwknvyarnv ninyia naacha rotoku. Darwknv kitaplo mindu ninyia naacha madv yika Enok Pwknvyarnvnyi mvngpu dubv ritoku. <verse eid="HEB 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6"/>Mvngjwng kaamabv yvvka Pwknvyarnvnyi mvngpu dubv rinyu mare, yvvdw Pwknvyarnv gvlo aadudw hv Pwknvyarnv doorungdo vla mvngjwng rungtoka okv yvvdw ninyia makar dunv um amina jire.<verse eid="HEB 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 6:13-22">Atk 6:13-22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mvngjwng lokv Noah Pwknvyarnv gv gamrw vdwa aainvlo, nwgv kaapa manam oguogu gv lvkwng nga tvvpa toku. Nw Pwknvyarnv gv minam ha tvvtoku okv svpw go pwktoku ho nw la okv nw gv vpin v ringnam ha paatoku. Vbvrikulokv nyiamooku hv miyakaya kotoku, okv mvngjwng lokv aanv darwkchongjor ha Noah Pwknvyarnv gvlo naarwk sitoku.<verse eid="HEB 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 12:1-5">Atk 12:1-5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mvngjwng lokv Abraham Pwknvyarnv gv ninyia diringmooku jinvpv vla milv kunam diringmooku lo vnglin yikv vla kanamla minam ha tvvtoku. Nw ogolo vngtv dunvdw um chimatola atubogv diringmooku nga vngyula vngtoku. <verse eid="HEB 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:27">Atk 35:27</ref></char></note>Mvngjwng lokv nw Pwknvyarnv gv ninyia milv kunam diringmooku lo nw nyebunyi gubvrila dootoku. Nw tombu lo dootoku, Isaak ka okv Jakob ka, bunyi Pwknvyarnv gvlokv milvvnam akin ha paatoku. <verse eid="HEB 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10"/>Abraham Pwknvyarnv gv doobwng dubv lvngtung dwlwkla, kaapu tain dubv mvlwk rilwkla pamtv mvnam ha kaayala dootoku.<verse eid="HEB 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 18:11-14">Atk 18:11-14</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 21:2">21:2</ref></char>
    </note>Mvngjwng kolokv Abrahamnyi abu gubvrila moto, nw achialvbv nyikam kubvka okv Sara ka nyirium nvgobv rikubvka. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Si mvgjwng gui vmidwv. Nw; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitaplo doodu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Si mvngjwng lokvto Saranyi kuu gvladubv mvnvgv, nw achialvbv hongula kuu dolamanv gobv rikujeka Nw.</char></note>Nw Pwknvyarnv gv milv nama rirungre vla mvngjwng toku. <verse eid="HEB 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Atk 15:5</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:17">22:17</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 32:12">32:12</ref></char></note> Abraham sikunv jvbv rikubvka, so nyi akin lokv nyido gv takar vdw jvbv okv svmasa gv adarai lo kila manam chokri aingbv husi hv doolin pvkunv.<verse eid="HEB 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 23:4">Atk 23:4</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 29:15">1Kri 29:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 39:12">Miri 39:12</ref></char>
    </note>So nyi mvnwng si mvngjwnglo sinya toku. Bunu Pwknvyarnv gv milv kunam yikungyira vdwa naarwk sima toku, vbvritola adu lokv bunu kaapato okv bunu torwk sitoku, okv bunu sichingmooku so nyebunyi gubv okv ngookarkunv nyi gubv mvngbwk sutoku. <verse eid="HEB 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14"/>Yvvbunudw svkvnv vdwa mindunv bunu atubogv lvgabv diringmooku ako makardu vla minbwk jitoku. <verse eid="HEB 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15"/>Bunu bunugv vngyu rokunam diringmooku gv lvgabv mvngbvmato; bunu vbv mvngnv guilo, bunu vngkur dukubv agi paapikui. <verse eid="HEB 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16"/>Vmabvya, bunugv paadubv vla mvngdv-mvngdv kunam diringmooku angv alvyaung nvgo, hv nyidomooku tologv diringmooku go. Okv vkvlvgabv Pwknvyarnv bunugv ninyia ngonugv Pwknvyarnv vla minjeka nw hinying matoku, ogulvgavbolo nw bunugv lvgabv pamtv go mvpvripv jitoku.<verse eid="HEB 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 22:1-14">Atk 22:1-14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Vdwlo Pwknvyarnv Abrahamnyi rikwripak tokudw mvngjwng ngv Abrahamnyi nw gv kuunyilo Isaaknyi erinpeelwk segubv mvla jitoku. Abraham Pwknvyarnv gv milv jikunam angv, vbvritola nw atubogv kuunyilo akin a erinpeelwk riji dubv doya toku. <verse eid="HEB 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Atk 21:12</ref></char></note>Pwknvyarnv ninyia minto, “Ngoogv naa husi doolinre vla milv kunam anga Isaak gvlokv doolinre.” <verse eid="HEB 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19"/>Pwknvyarnv Isaaknyi sinam loka turkur moreku vla Abraham mvngtinto—okv, vbv mvngku lokv, Abraham Isaaknyi sinam loka paakor toku. <verse eid="HEB 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:27-29">Atk 27:27-29</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 27:39">39</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 27:40">40</ref></char></note>Mvngjwng ngv Isaaknyi Jakob gvla Isau gv aainvlo bokta paaji nama milv motoku.<verse eid="HEB 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 27:27-29">Atk 27:27-29</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 27:39">39</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 27:40">40</ref></char>
    </note>Mvngjwng ngv Jakobnyi ninyigv sitv madvbv Josep gv kuunyilo vdwa bokta jilwk moto. Nw atubogv bangngi nga kvtor sila baabw tola Pwknvyarnvnyi kumtojotoku. <verse eid="HEB 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 50:24">Atk 50:24</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 50:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 13:19">Mog 13:19</ref></char></note>Mvngjwng lokv, Josep nw gv sitv tvrilo, Israel nyi vdwgv Ijipt lokv vnglin kuse nga minto, okv ninyigv svma nga ogubv rise ngvdw um gaam minla vvpv jitoku. <verse eid="HEB 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:2">Mog 2:2</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 1:22">Mog 1:22</ref></char></note>Mvngjwng lokv Moses gv anv-abua ninyia bvngro kochingbv poolu pwvmgo vvsi nyutoku. Ninyia bunu kaapunv kuunyilo gubv kaanyato, okv bunu dvbv gv orto nga tvvmabv rise nga busu matoku.<verse eid="HEB 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 2:10-12">Mog 2:10-12</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Mvngjwng lokv Moses vdwlo kai tokudw nw dvbv gv kuunyijar gv kuunyilo gubv minku svnga maakv vtoku. <verse eid="HEB 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25"/>Nw rimur rila achukgo ayungjvma go himpukain bv svngse yanga kayu tvla Pwknvyarnv gv nyi vdwa lvkobv hirukaya yabv svngse nga mvngyato. <verse eid="HEB 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26"/>Nw Ijipt gv nyitv nyigam nvnv yikungyira ngam svnga Kristo gv lvgabv hinching chingya svnga arv doya nvgobv mvngyato, ogulvgavbolo nw nyik v aainv amina kaagapto.<verse eid="HEB 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27"/>Mvngjwng ngv Mosesnyi dvbv gv haachi a busu madubv mvtola Ijipt mooku a vngyu motoku. Ho nw kaapa lamanam Pwknvyarnvnyi kaapanam aingbv, nw vngkur kuse nga maakv vtoku. <verse eid="HEB 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:21-30">Mog 12:21-30</ref></char></note> Mvngjwng ngv ninyia Israel nyi vdwgv kuunyilo bvngtu vdwa Sinv Nyidogindung vdwv mvki madubv naam agi gwngtung lo oyi paksak lakv vla mimula vbvrila vngbo dvmin ha rilin motoku.<verse eid="HEB 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 14:21-31">Mog 14:21-31</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mvngjwng lokv Israel nyi vdwv lwngchingnv svmasa nga dvpw lo vngnam apiabv vngbola vngrap toku; vdwlo Ijipt nyi vdwv vbv ritv tvvtokudw, bunua isi hv dvmit toku.<verse eid="HEB 11:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:30 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 6:12-21">Js 6:12-21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mvngjwng lokv Israel nyi vdwv alu kanw go bunu Jeriko gv vlwng svlung vdwa vngyit karto kudw vlwng svlung vdwv yaktoku. <verse eid="HEB 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 6:22-25">Js 6:22-25</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 2:1-21">Js 2:1-21</ref></char></note>Mvngjwng ngv Yooriak karnv Rahabnyi Pwknvyarnvnyi tvvmanv nyi vdwa lvkobv siming gvmumato, ogulvgavbolo nw Israel nyimak makru runv vdwa ajin-amin aingbv alvbv torwksinam lvgabv.<verse eid="HEB 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32"/>Ngo mindv dubvre? Ngo Gidion, Barak, Samson, Jepta, Dabid, Samuel okv nyijwk vdwgv lvkwng nga mindubv dw ngv chiyoma. <verse eid="HEB 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 6:1-27">Dan 6:1-27</ref></char></note> Mvngjwngnam lokv bunu diringmooku mooku mvnwng dvdv nga nyimak pala paaya yatoku. Bunu tarwk nvnga rinyato okv Pwknvyarnv gv milv kunam ha naarwk sinya toku. Bunu abwngapa vdwgv gaam ha mvtum nyatoku, <verse eid="HEB 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 3:1-30">Dan 3:1-30</ref></char></note>maatarbv gunv vmv nga mvngit nyatoku okv riokse lokv paki koomabv kitoku. Bunu lvvkumanv vdwv, vbvritola gwlwk nyatoku; bunu nyimaklo torbin lvvbin yanv gubvrila okv nyebu nyi vdwgv sipai vdwa mvya yatoku. <verse eid="HEB 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:17-24">1Dv 17:17-24</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 4:25-37">2Dv 4:25-37</ref></char></note>Mvngjwng lokv nyimv vdwv bunugv amiasa sikunv vdwa turkur dukubv paatoku.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 11:35">Kvvbi vdwv, ajarabi nama torwk simare vla turkur lakula alvyabv svngyakunam lvgabv mvdwkmvku kolo sinya toku. <verse eid="HEB 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:26">1Dv 22:26</ref>,<ref loc="1KI 22:27">27</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 18:25">2Kri 18:25</ref>,<ref loc="2CH 18:26">26</ref>; <ref loc="JER 20:2">Jer 20:2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 37:15">37:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 38:6">38:6</ref></char></note>Megonv vdwa nyarjikaula okv svnyak patoku, okv kvvbi vdwa jaako lwkla okv patwklo boolwk nyatoku. <verse eid="HEB 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 24:21">2Kri 24:21</ref></char></note> Bunua vlwng orki nyato, bunua hari lokv tungnyi gubv peetung nyatoku, bunua riokse lokv paki nyatoku. Bunu svlar okv yabin gv apin vdwa vji bv kotola vnggo karnyato—heema nyato, mvdwkmvku nyato, okv mvjikmvbik minto. <verse eid="HEB 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38"/>Tanyi mooku si bunugv lvgabv alvnvgobv riyo mato! Bunu diringmooku mooku kaamanv nyi jvbv rinyala chukrimooku lo okv moodw vdwlo ngookar nyatoku, lvngpwk vdwlo okv kvdw ungrung vdwlo doonya toku.<verse eid="HEB 11:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39"/>So gv lvkpvla pvvnam dvdv si bunugv mvngjwng lokv yaanam dvdv ngv! Rigvrila bunu Pwknvyarnv gv milv nama naarwk sima toku, <verse eid="HEB 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40"/>ogulvgavbolo Pwknvyarnv ngonugv lvgabv alvyanv rungnam go rungpv jiyato. Ninyigv mvngnam mv ngonu lvkobv rila bunu rvbwngchwng kunv gubv rire vla mvngtoku.<verse eid="HEB 11:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12"/>
  <para style="s">Pwknvyarnv ngonugv Abu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1"/>Ngonua lvkobv svkvnv kayatayanv kairungnv nyipam gobv ngonua dooyumdo. Vkvlvgabv ngonugv lamtvlo ogugo mvtumritum dudw ho vdwa mvala okv rimur hv ngonua jarbwngla rwkrwk mvla gakbwngla doodunv vdwa mva silaju, okv ngonu lamtv joktu jokse nga haapok jila jokla juka. <verse eid="HEB 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2"/>Klai ngonugv nyikkv Jisunyi rogap laju, ninyi gvlo ngonugv mvngjwng ngv atok lokv ataranya lobv mvngging dunv. Nw gv aainvlo mvngpu paase nga, nw daapo gv lvkwngbv topak matoku! Vmabvya nw daapo lo hinyinghirula sise lvkwngbv ogubvka mvngmato, okv nw vjak Pwknvyarnv gv dvbv dooging gv lakbik tangvlo doodukunv.<verse eid="HEB 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3"/>Nw ogugo ripv kudw um mvngkato, rimurnv nyi vdwgv achialvbv kaanwng mabv rinam a oguaingbv nw saktvla rito kubvdw! Vkvlvgabv nonuno atubongv mvngju sila topu mabvka. <verse eid="HEB 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4"/>Nonugv rimur ha turmilarmi sikulo nonu sinam nyenam gubv rimi siyo madv. <verse eid="HEB 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5,6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:17">Job 5:17</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:11">Nyit 3:11</ref>,<ref loc="PRO 3:12">12</ref></char></note>Pwknvyarnv gv nonua ninyigv kuu aingbv mintvmirula minam gamchar vdwa nonu mvngpa kuma lare?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">“Ngoogv kuu anga nga vdwlo Ahtu nam minsar nama tvvgap laka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:5">okv vdwlo nw naa yamredw no mvngju simabvka.<verse eid="HEB 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6"/>Ogulvgavbolo Ahtu nw gv paknam mvnwngnga nw minsar dunv,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:6">okv nw gv kuu anga jvbv torwksinama nw mvritririt dunv.”<verse eid="HEB 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7"/>Nonunogv hinching chingnam a abu gv mvritriritnam gubv no saktv laka; nonugv hinching chingnam lokv kaapadu Pwknvyarnv nonua nw gv kuu ayingbv mvgvdu. Abu gv mvdwkmvku manam kuu anga go dobv lare? <verse eid="HEB 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8"/>Nonuno nw gv kuu mvnwng vdwa mvnam apiabv, nonua mvritririt madubolo hv manv nonu nw gv jvjvnv kuu vdwvma, vbvritola dvchoyirv nvgv kuu vdwv. <verse eid="HEB 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9"/>Tanyi amar lokv ngonugv abu vdwlo minbolo, bunu ngonua mvdwkmvku do okv ngonu bunua mvngdv dunv. Vbvrikunamv, ngonugv yalu gv Abu lo ngonu vdwgo tolwklaklwk sirungla ridudodu kubv ridukunv! <verse eid="HEB 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10"/>Ngonugv tanyi amar abu vdwv ngonua dw achuk gv lvgabv mvdwkmvku namv, kaarinyi bunu riinbv ridu; vbvritola Pwknvyarnv um ngonugv alvnam lvgabv ridu, vkvlvgavbolo ngonu ninyigv darwk nama baak paamwng gvdubv. <verse eid="HEB 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11"/>Vdwlo ngonua mvritririt rikudw, kaarinyi hv ho dw lo mvngpu lvgabvma, ngonua mvngru monam lvgabv. Vbv yvv bunua mvritriritla tamsarnam vdwv aainvlo tarwkbaakbv turnam okv sarsopoyo gv amina paariku.<verse eid="HEB 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tamsarnam okv Gamrwnam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 35:3">Aij 35:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Vbvrikunamv, nonugv laakyu kunv laak kv idung toka, okv nonugv jinjinrumrumnv lvbwng ngv gwlwk motokuka! <verse eid="HEB 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 4:6">Nyit 4:6</ref></char></note>Sorchinv lamtv vdwlo vngkar dvdv toka, vkvlvgavbolo lvpiknv lvpa ngv vngnyu mabv rima dubv, vbvritola poyadukubv.<verse eid="HEB 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14"/>Mvnwngnga sarsopoyo bv ribam dubv rikw laka, okv darwkbv turdubv rikw laka, ogulvgavbolo vbv rimabv yvvka Ahtunyi kaapa mare. <verse eid="HEB 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:18">Det 29:18</ref></char></note>Pwknvyarnv gv anyuaya lokv dakkur svnga hima sutoka. Yvvnyika kvvchaknv singnv ngv svngchala okv chumdwk lokv achialv gonyi adwkaku monam aingbv rimu mabvka. <verse eid="HEB 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:29-34">Atk 25:29-34</ref></char></note>Yvvnyika Isau gv jvbv gwngngmurla vmalo darwkmanv gubvrila, lvkin go achin dvnam mvngchik gv lvgabv nw gv achi gubvrila kaiyabv yikungyira paase nga pyogga sinv aingbv rimu mabvka. <verse eid="HEB 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:30-40">Atk 27:30-40</ref></char></note>Nonuno chindu, ho kochingbv nw abu gv bokta nga naarwk sidukubv mvngtoku; nw nyikla sarla makar kubvka abuv ninyia hvngkur toku, ogulvgavbolo nw riro kunam ha lvkodv ridin dukubv lamtv kaaku matoku. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:17 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ho lvgabv kaakarto; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nw boktalwkji naama paanam lvgabv rikw toku.</char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:18</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 19:16-22">Mog 19:16-22</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:18-21">20:18-21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:11">Det 4:11</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 4:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:22-27">5:22-27</ref></char>
    </note> Nonu Israel nyi vdwgv aanam aingbv aama, nonugv hinla jinamv, Sinai Moodw lo vmv gugo dvbv, kanv pulwkla okv kanv jikriak to, doogumdoori rila, <verse eid="HEB 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19"/>pungli tapu akogv dunam v, okv vlv gv adu v, vdwlo nyi vdwv vlv adua tvvtokudw, bunu gamchar gudv tvvmu kumabvkv vla kootoku, <verse eid="HEB 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:12">Mog 19:12</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 19:13">13</ref></char></note>Ogulvgavbolo “Svnwngsvmin gunvka moodw am mvsit bolo, um vlwng orki runglaka.” Vla ortojinam ha bunu tvvnyu kuma toku. <verse eid="HEB 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:19">Det 9:19</ref></char></note>Bunu kaanamv achialvbv busu kaapa toku vbvrila Moses mintoku, “Ngo busula okv jinjinrumrum pvnv!”<verse eid="HEB 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22"/>Vbvritola, nonu Jayon Moodw lo okv turnv Pwknvyarnv gv pamtv nyido mookugv Jerusalem lo, hoka hejar-hejar bv nyidogindung vdwgv doopam kolo, hoka nonu aatoku. <verse eid="HEB 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23"/>Pwknvyarnv gv kuunyilo bvngtu mvnwng gv amina nyidomooku gv kitaplo lvkpv duku ho vdwgv himpu mvngpula doopam kolo nonu aaduku. Pwknvyarnv gvlo aadu yvvdw nyi nga jwngkadaka dunv, okv alvnv nyi vdwgv dow nga rvbwng mokunam vdwgvlo nonu aalwk duku. <verse eid="HEB 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:10">Atk 4:10</ref></char></note>Anw bv milv kunam ha mvkimvak pvkunv Jisu gvlo nonu aadu, okv Abel gv oyi sarnam ha alvyanv ogu milvla oyi paksakku ho aalwkduku.<verse eid="HEB 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:22">Mog 20:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Vbvrikunamv, nonu hima sulaka, okv yvv japdudw ninyi tvvya mabv riyoka. Yvvdw akonvgv Sichingmooku so darwknv doin japnam ha tvvmabv toa kunv vdwv ringsu lamanyato. Vbvrikubolo, nyidomooku tologv japnv anga ngonu dakkur kubolo achuk guka ringsu lajiku kaama! <verse eid="HEB 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAG 2:6">Hag 2:6</ref></char></note>Ho gv dw lo Ninyigv vlv ngv Sichingmookua hwkdinto, vbvritola vjak nw milv toku, “Ngo lvkodv Sichingmookua hwkdin mwngmare nyidomooku haka hwkdin re.” <verse eid="HEB 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27"/>“Lvkodv” vnam gamchar lokv kaatamdu pwknamyarnam oguogu vdw si hwkdin reku okv naala naa riku, vbvrikubolo hwkdin nyumanv oguogu vdwv doobwngre.<verse eid="HEB 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28"/>Vbvrikunamv, klai ngonu umbonyikv vla kuju, ogulvgavbolo ngonu hwkdin nyumanv karv nga naarwk supvku. Klai ngonu Pwknvyarnvnyi busula achialvbv mvngdvla, ogunv lamtv lokv ninyia mvngpu dubv rise ngvdw umbonyikv vla ninyia kumlajola kuju; <verse eid="HEB 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:24">Det 4:24</ref></char></note>ogulvgavbolo ngonugv Pwknvyarnv jvjv bv mvyakmvchaknv vmv ngv.<verse eid="HEB 12:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13"/>
  <para style="s">Pwknvyarnvnyi oguaingbv mvngpu monam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1"/>Kristan nyi vdwbv akin-akinha pakmi sibwng laka. <verse eid="HEB 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:1-8">Atk 18:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:1-3">19:1-3</ref></char></note>Nonugv naam lo nyi kaachin manam vdwa aamunam lvgabv mvngpa mabv riyoka. Nyi megonv kvvlo vbvrila oguchimabv nyidogindung vdwa aamula ritoku. <verse eid="HEB 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3"/>Yvvbunudw patwklo doodudw, nonuno bunua lvkobv patwklo dooming gvnam aingbv mvngpa laka. Yvvbunudw hinching chinla doodudw, nonuno bunua lvkobv hinching chingmin gvnam aingbv mvngpa laka. <verse eid="HEB 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4"/>Nyida nga nyi mvnwng gv mvngdvnam gubvka, okv nywngnyilu vdwv jwkjwkvrwk minsu dubv rimi sirung laka. Yvvbunudw gwngmur dunv okv yvvbunudw nywng nyilubv ritola kvvbi vdwa doogvkargv dunv Pwknvyarnv bunua jwngkadaka reku.<verse eid="HEB 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 31:6">Det 31:6</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 31:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 1:5">Js 1:5</ref></char>
    </note> Nonugv singnamlo morko nga mvngbiu namlo adu laka, okv no hvkamgo doopvdw hum nyumchi nvgobv rito laka. Ogulvgavbolo Pwknvyarnv mintoku, “Ngo vdwloka nonua vngyu mare; ngo vdwloka nonua topak mare.” <verse eid="HEB 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:6">Miri 118:6</ref></char></note>Vbvrikunamv, klai ngonu mvngrw dvla vbv minlaju,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">“Ahtu nga ridur rianv,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:6">Ngo busu mare.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">Yvv nga ogu rila rinv?”<verse eid="HEB 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7"/>Nonua Pwknvyarnv gv doin a japjikunv kvvlo gv rigvdogvnv vdwa mvngpa laka. Mvngkor kaatoka bunu oguaingbv svngpvripv kudw okv sipv kudw, bunugv mvngjwng nga riming gvto laka. <verse eid="HEB 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8"/>Jisu Kristo meru jeka, silu jeka, okv dvbvsingtam lojvka akin v. <verse eid="HEB 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9"/>Nonua angu-angusinv tamsar vdwv jvjvnv lamtv loka vnggv koma bvka. So si Pwknvyarnv gv anyuaya lokv ngonu arwng gwlwk naarwksinam si alvdu, okv dvnamtvngnam gv lvkwngbv pvbv nga tvvnam lokvma, yvvbunudw so pvbv sum tvvdunv ho vdwv bunu gvlo ridur paamato.<verse eid="HEB 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10"/>Jius vdwgv kumkujoku mooku lo nyibubv rila ririanv vdwv ngonugv erinpeelwk lwkku yugwng lokv ogugoka dvla madunv. <verse eid="HEB 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:27">Leb 16:27</ref></char></note> Jius Butvyachoknv angv svnwngsvmin vdwgv oyi a rimur vdwgv lvgabv erinpeelwk jidubv Darwkyachoknv Karchung lo bvnglwkdo; vbvritola svnwngsvmin gv ayak vdwa tombu gv agum lo vmv ramyok do. <verse eid="HEB 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12"/>Vkvlvkwngbv Jisu ka nw atubogv oyi lokv nyi vdwa rimur loka darwk dukubv mvnam lvgabv, pamtv gv agum lo sitoku. <verse eid="HEB 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13"/>Vbvrikunamv, klai ngonu ninyia lvkobv tombu agum lo vngla okv ninyigv hinying nga gvpingvin minggv laju. <verse eid="HEB 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14"/>Vkvlvgavbolo ngonugv lvgabv Sichingmooku so doobwng jinv pamtv kaama; pamtv aajinv anga ngonu makar dunv. <verse eid="HEB 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15"/>Vbvrikunamv, Jisu gv amin lokv ngonu Pwknvyarnv gv amina kaimonamv hv ngonugv erinpeelwk gubv mvla alu gv dwkia ninyia jire, ho daan hv nabor lokv jinamv, yvvdw ninyia Ahtu vdnu. <verse eid="HEB 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16"/>Alvnv kudungkua rinam okv akin-akin a ridur minsu nama mvngpa mabv riyoka, ogulvgavbolo svbvrinam si Pwknvyarnvnyi mvngpu dubv erinpeelwknam vdwv.<verse eid="HEB 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17"/>Nonua rigvdogvnv vdwgv minam ha tvvlarilaka okv bunugv mingkulo vngming gvlaka. Bunu doonudaknu mabv nonugv yalu a kayatayado, ogulvgavbolo bunu bunugv kudungkua rinam ha lvkpv nama Pwknvyarnvnyi jidukubv rirungdu. Nonuno bunua tvvboribolo, bunu kudungkua nga mvngpula rire; vbvmabolo, bunu um mvngru dula rire, okv hv nonugv lvgabv ridurnam gubv rimare.<verse eid="HEB 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18"/>Ngonugv lvgabv kumbv laka. Ngonu jvjvbv mongrumara ngv mvngbwk dunv, ogulvgavbolo ngonu dw mvnwnglo jvjv nvnga ridubv mvngdunv. <verse eid="HEB 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19"/>Okv ngo nonua achialvbv koola mindunv Pwknvyarnv nga nonu gvlo baapubv vngkur monam lvgabv kaiyayabv haapok jila kumto laka.<verse eid="HEB 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kumnyungbv Kumnam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20"/>Ninyigv erinpeelwk sula siji kunam gv oyi <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:20 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nwgv oyiv; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nwgv erinpeelwksula sinamhv.</char></note>lokv kairungnv svlar kaaya nvbv rinv ngonugv Ahtu Jisunyi Pwknvyarnv siku nvnga turkur motoku, vbvrinam hv doobwngnv milv nama mvu pvvnam mv. <verse eid="HEB 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21"/>Sarsopoyonv Pwknvyarnv nw gv mvnggiabv rinam lvgabv nonua alvnv ogumvnwngnga jigv yika, okv Jisu Kristo gv lokv nw gv mvngpubv ngonua rilaka. Okv Kristo dvbvsingtam bv yunglit nvgobv ribv laka! Amen.<verse eid="HEB 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Minyakunam gamchar vdwv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22"/>Ngoogv ajin vdwa ngo nonua kodwkrwkla mindunv, so gv mintvmirunam doinha saktv tvla tvvya laka; ogulvgavbolo ngoogv nonua siti lvknam si awgo asuma. <verse eid="HEB 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23"/>Ngo nonua ngonugv boru Timoti patwk lokv linpvku vla chimuso mvngdu. Nw baapubv aaku namgo kaabolo, vdwlo ngo nonua kaarikudw ngo ninyia ngo lvkobv aagvriku.<verse eid="HEB 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24"/>Ngonugv kumrwklvtak ka rigvdogvnv vdwa okv Pwknvyarnv gv nyi vdwa jiji laka. Itali lokv mvngjwngnv vdwv nonua bunugv kumrwklvtak ha jilwk nyadu.<verse eid="HEB 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25"/>Pwknvyarnv gv anyuaya ngv nonu mvnwng gvlo lvkobv doolaka.<verse eid="HEB 13:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13"/>
</usx>
